# Every FORMAT value, bound to the node that identifies record, sample and key.
#
# Only GT is compared by q05/q06, so a mangled DP, GQ or AD would otherwise
# pass. The FormatFieldValue IRI already encodes record, sample and key, so
# hashing it with the value makes each cell individually accountable.
